BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (      Wisely, they returned more than was given. The first village's spring overflowed with the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        returned water. Seeing this, they gave again, even more generously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
