BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        ntentions over precise measurements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      The myth teaches: *True abundance flows from the courage to give first, the wisdom to retu) Tj ET
